--- The AArch64 shapes a kernel written in Oli-- needs (design 0025).
module core.a64

--- What a slot of the vector table `olic` emits saves before it calls a
--- `calls interrupt` procedure, from the address it passes upward: x0-x18,
--- x30, ELR_EL1 and SPSR_EL1 (then v0-v7, not named here). The slot puts
--- every one back and returns with `eret`, so `elr` is where the
--- interrupted code resumes.
pub layout ExceptionFrame
    x : [19]u64
    lr : u64
    elr : u64
    spsr : u64
end
